{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">無綫劇集《非份之罪》單元《一億殺機》於15日播出最終回，劇情高潮迭起，其中帶弟（林秀怡飾）將已故紹聰（施焯日飾）生前留下的名牌披肩及心意卡送給嫲嫲淑嫻（盧宛茵飾）的一幕，成為全晚最催淚的焦點，令無數觀眾動容落淚。</p><div class=\"source-inline-chip-container luminous-sources hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted\" data-rich-content=\"true\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></div><p id=\"p-rc_c550fa34074c4331-61\" style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">劇情講述宏智（徐榮飾）為了保護愛妻悅萍（陳煒飾），向警方自首承認殺害紹聰，儘管淑嫻與帶弟皆深知事實並非如此，但宏智的供詞幾乎毫無破綻。淑嫻因愛子心切，竟向警方自認是兇手，帶弟為救嫲嫲，在苦尋證據下終於證明淑嫻清白。然而淑嫻對此並不領情，更痛苦地反問：「你證明我冇殺死聰仔，我點救阿智呀？」</p><p id=\"p-rc_c550fa34074c4331-61\" style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"40976800-f885-4fe5-9e69-b7238c6fd080.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/20266gYkt5sQ5s1784170664.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"40976800-f885-4fe5-9e69-b7238c6fd080.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"source-inline-chip-container luminous-sources hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted\" data-rich-content=\"true\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></div><p id=\"p-rc_c550fa34074c4331-62\" style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">帶弟眼見嫲嫲偏執至此，痛心地回應：「阿嫲，聰仔已經死得好慘，我唔會畀你亂咁認罪，更加唔會畀老竇冤枉入獄呀！」</p><div class=\"source-inline-chip-container luminous-sources hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted\" data-rich-content=\"true\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></div><p id=\"p-rc_c550fa34074c4331-63\" style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">隨後，帶弟哭著揭露真相，指案發當晚雖然與紹聰大吵一場，但單純的他內心全無怨恨，反而一心記掛著嫲嫲。紹聰生前特意為嫲嫲選購了她心儀已久的名牌披肩，並寫下一張感人心意卡。</p><div class=\"source-inline-chip-container luminous-sources hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted\" data-rich-content=\"true\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">劇中背景響起紹聰溫柔的告白，親自讀出卡上的字句：「嫲嫲，你唔好嬲我啦！嬲人好傷身㗎，呢條名牌披肩雖然好貴，不過質料好好，我知你一直唔拾得買，等我繼承咗爺爺嘅遺產，我應承你以後你鍾意咩嘢，無論幾貴，我都會買畀你……嫲嫲，我愛你。」</p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"d97204a7-9eb3-471b-ae46-facc9884f8e0.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026WiK6tiCbBZ1784170668.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"d97204a7-9eb3-471b-ae46-facc9884f8e0.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"46fc480e-aa57-43cc-9aa9-c11d1cd889f2.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026g7o6HCmfow1784170672.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"46fc480e-aa57-43cc-9aa9-c11d1cd889f2.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h3 style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></h3><p id=\"p-rc_c550fa34074c4331-65\" style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">這份毫無保留的愛錫令淑嫻深受感動，帶弟為嫲嫲披上披肩後，嫲嫲深切感受到孫兒的那份孝心，忍不住抱着帶弟痛哭失聲。</p><div class=\"source-inline-chip-container luminous-sources hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted\" data-rich-content=\"true\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></div><p id=\"p-rc_c550fa34074c4331-66\" style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">大批觀眾觀後紛紛表示這場戲催淚指數爆燈，力讚林秀怡與盧宛茵的精湛演繹，特別是配上紹聰的配音，完美展現出不捨與思念的感情遞進。網民留言直呼：「太感人，睇到喊晒」、「聰仔同帶弟都好錫嫲嫲」、「大家要好好愛錫身邊人」。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-16T13:19:05.224597+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":668,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}